    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d551-a1">

                <pb facs="0488" n="414" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg414"/>

                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Shanghai,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-11-01"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November</hi> 1, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>I have been directed by his excellency the honorable Anson Burlingame, United
                    States minister plenipotentiary and envoy extraordinary to China, to publish the
                    following decrees of 22d and 23d April last. Under the provisions of the act of
                    Congress they become of binding force and effect from this date. Certified
                    copies of the decrees have gone forward for simultaneous publication at the
                    several ports.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>GEO. F. SEWARD, <hi rendition="#italic">Consul
                    General.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
